WEBVTT

01:32.650 --> 01:35.070
Hey, hey, they're coming tomorrow, right?

01:35.170 --> 01:38.400
Oh, those umm... trial transfer students from the Kanenone Gakuen, right?

01:38.700 --> 01:42.130
I wonder what kind of guys they are?
Will any of them be cool guys?

01:42.130 --> 01:45.130
They'll probably be like monkeys if they
come from deep in the mountains.

01:45.130 --> 01:46.410
I guess you are right.

01:51.090 --> 01:54.250
What the hell, where is everyone?

02:02.100 --> 02:03.140
Are you not feeling ok?

02:04.060 --> 02:07.610
I-I'm alright.
I was just a little surprised.

02:07.610 --> 02:08.820
If I drink some medicine...

02:09.020 --> 02:09.670
"Surprised"?

02:14.660 --> 02:16.120
Oh, a haunted house.

02:16.320 --> 02:17.420
Sanae-chan!

02:18.620 --> 02:23.120
It's gonna spill!

02:25.210 --> 02:26.500
I'm sorry!

02:26.500 --> 02:28.380
Sanae-chan, please wait a second!

02:28.380 --> 02:31.000
Wait!

02:31.000 --> 02:34.580
Instead of you scooping up the water, it's faster to carry her there.

02:35.880 --> 02:37.810
Where's the drinking fountain?

02:37.810 --> 02:39.810
This way.

02:44.810 --> 02:48.110
Oh, there are crows even in the city.

02:48.110 --> 02:51.020
Crows have a habit of collecting
things that sparkle.

02:51.020 --> 02:53.530
-Keep that in your eye!

02:52.740 --> 02:54.320
-What the hell are you doing?!

02:54.490 --> 02:56.060
Who is it?

03:00.160 --> 03:02.390
I didn't know you liked this kind
of things, Haruno-san.

03:02.390 --> 03:04.370
Now wait a minute, Futaba-chan.

03:04.580 --> 03:07.220
There's no way I would enjoy stupid
things like these.

03:07.320 --> 03:08.530
Yeah, you are right.

03:11.650 --> 03:12.550
Wakaba!

03:12.760 --> 03:14.180
Y-Yes, Onee-sama!

03:15.100 --> 03:16.300
Noo...!

03:18.180 --> 03:25.560
...then I heard about some bastards who are trying to
grope female students in the dark.

03:28.940 --> 03:30.560
NOOOO!

03:30.660 --> 03:32.660
I'll eat you!

03:32.860 --> 03:34.710
Sorry, you are not scary.

03:34.810 --> 03:35.590
Wha...?

03:35.890 --> 03:38.250
Because things like you don't exist.

03:39.450 --> 03:40.350
They're huge!

03:41.280 --> 03:45.830
No! Idiot!
Watch where you're grabbing!

03:56.220 --> 03:59.730
Um... thank you very much.

03:59.930 --> 04:00.950
No problem.

04:01.550 --> 04:03.870
Thanks for your help.
It must have been tought.

04:04.260 --> 04:07.630
You must be thirsty since you were sweating.

04:07.890 --> 04:11.160
Eh? Um, this is...

04:15.360 --> 04:17.530
M-My name's Chitose Midori.

04:18.530 --> 04:20.550
Oh, I'm Takasaki Yuusuke.

04:20.950 --> 04:22.490
I'll leave it here.

04:22.490 --> 04:25.660
-NOOOO!

04:24.660 --> 04:25.660
-Hey wait!

04:25.110 --> 04:25.960
-You guys!

04:26.160 --> 04:26.530
Eh?

04:26.590 --> 04:29.680
-Forgive me!

04:28.120 --> 04:29.680
-Damn you!

04:28.830 --> 04:30.900
-Eh? Bacchigu and Ichibanboshi?

04:32.100 --> 04:34.200
I have to go.

04:34.300 --> 04:35.100
Um...

04:35.100 --> 04:36.500
Wait right there!

04:37.800 --> 04:38.830
WAIT!

04:41.430 --> 04:42.800
STAY RIGHT THERE!

04:42.800 --> 04:43.990
I told you to wait!

04:49.690 --> 04:51.270
Socho! Itsuki!

04:51.270 --> 04:52.970
Tenjin! Dokugasu!

04:53.010 --> 04:54.840
SAVE US!

04:55.520 --> 04:56.960
Get those two!

04:56.980 --> 04:57.930
They're perverts!

04:58.930 --> 05:00.790
He groped my breast!

05:01.110 --> 05:02.990
WHAT CHA' SAY?!

05:05.490 --> 05:06.960
Aijou!

05:05.490 --> 05:06.960
[ Note:  Aijou (Expression of Love) ]

05:12.960 --> 05:15.190
Bacchigu, Ichibanboshi...

05:18.590 --> 05:22.220
...that's how it is.
For the rest of the week,

05:22.430 --> 05:28.230
the boys from Kanenone Gakuen will be studying amongst us.

05:28.430 --> 05:34.340
This will also test our school to see if it
is ready to go co-ed in the future.

05:34.860 --> 05:43.090
I expect you girls to behave as the serene and nice
Hananoka Gakuen students that you are.

05:43.810 --> 05:47.260
Hah! What does she mean by "serene and nice"?

05:48.330 --> 05:49.820
W-What is it?

05:51.620 --> 05:54.570
This doesn't mean that we have forgiven you.

05:55.040 --> 05:59.190
We haven't said anything because Regent-senpai
told us to keep this under wraps.

06:00.010 --> 06:06.360
If you cause any more mischief, we'll tell the teachers
and get you guys out immediately.

06:15.560 --> 06:20.530
NO ENTRY FOR BOYS BEYOND THIS POINT

06:17.820 --> 06:20.360
So we have bunk beds, huh?

06:20.530 --> 06:24.250
At Kanenone we sleept in the closet.
This is heaven compared to that.

06:25.450 --> 06:26.810
The futon is dry!

06:27.910 --> 06:31.720
It's been years since last time!
This is great!

06:35.620 --> 06:38.990
Hey Tenjin, aren't those
Bacchigu and Ichibanboshi's bags?

06:39.380 --> 06:43.000
Those two gave me their bags and
went off somewhere.

06:43.800 --> 06:45.000
Went off somewhere?

06:45.300 --> 06:47.810
They said they wanted to go
exploring or something...

06:48.010 --> 06:49.180
"Exploring"?

06:49.180 --> 06:50.900
I think I know where they went.

06:51.100 --> 06:53.570
Is Takasaki Yuusuke-kun here?

07:19.170 --> 07:21.270
Men are the worst!

07:23.460 --> 07:25.860
About yesterday, thank you very much.

07:25.880 --> 07:28.200
No, I didn't do it to be thanked.

07:33.100 --> 07:34.740
She's beautiful...

07:35.140 --> 07:40.650
And to return the favor, we're here
to show you around the school.

07:40.650 --> 07:41.910
Thanks.

07:42.110 --> 07:46.450
Because of yesterday's incident, things are not going well with the girls.

07:46.450 --> 07:48.220
Then, shall we go?

07:50.320 --> 07:54.490
Yuusuke-dono, are you trying to abandon me?

07:54.700 --> 07:59.370
I won't help you even if you're in
the same TV commercial!

08:01.900 --> 08:02.600
Shut up already...

08:02.970 --> 08:04.760
Can he come along?

08:04.760 --> 08:05.760
Of course!

08:05.760 --> 08:06.710
How about you Itsuki?

08:06.810 --> 08:08.150
I'll pass.

08:08.840 --> 08:10.540
Then let's go!

08:10.640 --> 08:12.190
Come on Tenjin, we're going.

08:13.810 --> 08:16.090
Hey! Don't leave me behind!

08:22.190 --> 08:24.670
The smell of youth!

08:25.070 --> 08:28.150
I'm in a field with girls... lots of girls!

08:39.750 --> 08:41.170
Socho...

08:41.170 --> 08:43.830
Do you have any talents, Yuusuke-kun?

08:44.920 --> 08:45.600
Me?

08:47.800 --> 08:48.980
How about judo?

08:49.380 --> 08:52.480
Oh! We do that in class.

08:52.680 --> 08:54.470
Really? I want to see!

08:58.770 --> 09:02.510
What is she thinking...?

09:03.110 --> 09:05.900
Chitose-senpai, is this really ok?

09:05.980 --> 09:06.930
I don't know.

09:06.980 --> 09:13.300
Yuusuke-dono! Show her how terrible
men can be until she's traumatized!

09:23.330 --> 09:25.410
I prepared all this for you...

09:25.710 --> 09:27.080
You shouldn't lose!

09:27.380 --> 09:32.000
If you win, everyone will change their
attitude, especially Hotta-senpai.

09:32.400 --> 09:33.300
I see.

09:35.300 --> 09:38.260
Were you distracted by your opponent's breast?

09:38.560 --> 09:40.020
T-That's not true...

09:41.620 --> 09:42.760
Pervert.

09:47.840 --> 09:49.870
Sanae-chan!

09:50.280 --> 09:54.610
Are you talking about the girl who looks like she belongs
in the elementary school instead of middle school?

09:58.870 --> 10:02.190
Dude, are you really serious?

10:02.830 --> 10:06.970
Of course! If you underestimate my lolita
complex, I'll kill you.

10:07.770 --> 10:13.120
It'll make me wake up excited every morning.

10:13.800 --> 10:15.630
That's not good, you know.

10:20.070 --> 10:22.790
So this is the smell of a female!

10:23.190 --> 10:24.700
Is Itsuki sick?

10:24.800 --> 10:25.500
-I don't know.

10:24.800 --> 10:29.260
-Oh yeah, we've never took a bath with Itsuki before.

10:41.730 --> 10:46.180
Just a while ago, girls were in this bath...

10:50.840 --> 10:53.940
I'll think of it as some good juice!

10:56.140 --> 10:58.030
What are you doing?

10:58.230 --> 10:58.800
Wha-?

11:06.230 --> 11:08.330
Do you have a girlfriend in your school?

11:08.480 --> 11:10.440
Kobayashi-kun, what kind of girl you like?

11:10.440 --> 11:11.730
A girl who is quiet.

11:11.730 --> 11:12.970
COOL!

11:14.470 --> 11:17.770
Well, let's put aside the fact that
Itsuki's a player.

11:19.070 --> 11:20.920
Socho is in karate.

11:21.700 --> 11:24.110
Tenjin is with a girl from ninth grade.

11:24.410 --> 11:27.160
Kuyashu-kun, I didn't know you
liked things like that.

11:27.170 --> 11:29.500
Then, do you know White Magic?

11:29.500 --> 11:31.000
-Yeah, I know some.

11:30.590 --> 11:33.510
-Even that Dokugasu is...

11:33.510 --> 11:35.430
And how about us?!

11:35.500 --> 11:37.400
This can't be forgiven!

11:37.430 --> 11:40.670
But you know, you did that
first impression...

11:40.970 --> 11:46.360
You're blaming me? Aren't we friends?
What are you gonna do to our friendship?

11:48.060 --> 11:52.610
Calm down dude.
What Yuusuke's saying is true.

11:55.010 --> 11:59.020
Bacchigu, have you tried apologizing in person?

12:00.080 --> 12:02.630
Hey, Futaba-chan.

12:04.730 --> 12:06.580
All right...

12:07.580 --> 12:09.060
To all girls!

12:10.960 --> 12:13.110
Let's forget about the thing that happened before!

12:14.210 --> 12:17.660
Let's be friends and love eachother!
Is that ok?

12:18.330 --> 12:20.040
Why don't you forget it!

12:20.340 --> 12:22.330
You haven't apologized enough!

12:22.500 --> 12:23.400
Apologized?

12:23.430 --> 12:23.910
Idiot!

12:23.910 --> 12:24.720
Yuck!

12:24.720 --> 12:25.350
Die!

12:25.950 --> 12:26.600
Dirty old man!

12:26.700 --> 12:27.900
Damn you!

12:29.900 --> 12:31.100
Yuusuke-kun!

12:31.600 --> 12:33.100
Chitose.

12:33.360 --> 12:36.200
Ijuuin-kun and Ichibanboshi-kun, hello.

12:39.200 --> 12:40.900
Who is Ijuuin?

12:40.950 --> 12:42.100
Is there someone with that name?

12:42.160 --> 12:43.120
There isn't.

12:43.120 --> 12:46.000
It's me, ME! Why would you forget me?

12:46.040 --> 12:49.600
[ Note: In Japan, the name Ijuuin sound like a name of a rich boy ]

12:46.040 --> 12:49.600
You idiot!
That name's wasted on a pervert like you!

12:49.700 --> 12:51.240
Shut up, bitch!

12:51.380 --> 12:52.560
WHAT!

12:54.960 --> 12:59.170
Futaba-chan and Ijuuin-kun, let's not fight.

12:59.430 --> 13:03.380
Midori-chan, there's no way we could
be friends with guys like them!

13:03.680 --> 13:04.200
"Guys like them"...

13:06.100 --> 13:08.980
I don't think they're bad people.

13:09.180 --> 13:12.270
How can you think a guy who does perverted acts isn't a bad guy?!

13:13.270 --> 13:19.240
Futaba-chan, about that incident...
I think our mischief went too far.

13:19.240 --> 13:22.870
So we're very sorry!

13:22.870 --> 13:24.710
Don't come...

13:27.400 --> 13:29.100
NEAR ME!

13:29.710 --> 13:30.910
Futaba-chan!

13:37.460 --> 13:39.340
Can you breathe?

13:40.540 --> 13:42.650
I-I'm in love!

13:43.400 --> 13:44.400
She's an adult.

13:52.850 --> 13:54.350
Socho's gone, right?

13:54.730 --> 13:57.160
Guys, what are you...

13:59.190 --> 14:01.980
Dude, what do you think about Chitose Midori?

14:02.240 --> 14:05.320
What do you mean by that?
Well... uh?

14:06.200 --> 14:10.910
She comes to talk with us even though she's in a different class!

14:11.300 --> 14:12.370
Y-Yeah.

14:14.370 --> 14:18.670
Maybe if I put it this way, even someone as thick as you would understand. She's in love.

14:19.000 --> 14:20.900
She is?

14:21.800 --> 14:22.400
With me.

14:23.700 --> 14:24.240
Eh?

14:24.240 --> 14:29.140
She gave me tons of emotion!
It wouldn't be manly to do nothing about it!

14:31.210 --> 14:31.870
Wha?

14:32.270 --> 14:34.440
I'm not into this sort of thing...

14:34.440 --> 14:35.650
Ichibanboshi?

14:35.650 --> 14:37.640
But we have only one day left.

14:37.940 --> 14:44.590
I'll make that aggressive girl fall in love with me
and make her say "Ichibanboshi-sama".

14:46.190 --> 14:46.990
Hey!

14:46.990 --> 14:49.490
I'll be a man!

14:47.740 --> 14:49.490
What are you guys talking about?

14:49.490 --> 14:50.490
In short:

14:51.410 --> 14:52.540
Sneaky night-love.

14:52.910 --> 14:54.420
Sneaky night-love?

14:54.420 --> 14:56.320
Chitose... Chitose is in danger!

14:56.330 --> 14:58.780
Calm down.
There's no need to worry.

14:58.880 --> 14:59.810
B-But!

15:00.210 --> 15:03.900
It's a girl's dormitory.
They're bound to be prepared.

15:04.220 --> 15:05.120
Prepared?

15:05.620 --> 15:07.410
Ah! A pervert!

15:07.410 --> 15:09.100
What? Where?!

15:08.510 --> 15:10.680
Mother, how are you?

15:10.680 --> 15:12.770
We are in the city right now.

15:12.970 --> 15:14.670
The city is a very scary place.

15:14.770 --> 15:18.110
Today, thanks to Ichibanboshi I have
meet another tragic situation.

15:18.110 --> 15:18.960
It's your fault.

15:18.980 --> 15:20.070
No, it's your fault.

15:20.070 --> 15:21.280
No, no, it's your fault.

15:21.280 --> 15:22.260
Definitely your fault.

15:23.860 --> 15:26.540
Wha-wha-wha what?!

15:27.240 --> 15:28.920
It's a false accusation!

15:29.120 --> 15:31.980
Right! Right!
Yuusuke, I was in the dorm right?!

15:31.980 --> 15:32.800
Huh? Yeah...

15:33.040 --> 15:34.030
Liar!

15:37.330 --> 15:40.420
First of all, you're saying we've cause last night's commotion,

15:40.920 --> 15:44.070
but do you have any evidence, Futaba-chan?

15:44.670 --> 15:47.090
How did you get those scars?

15:47.190 --> 15:48.590
T-These?

15:48.890 --> 15:51.840
I tripped when we were chasing
a female beetle...

15:53.240 --> 15:54.600
Sound cheesy.

15:54.600 --> 15:58.060
H-Hey Yuusuke!
It was a female beetle this big, right?

15:58.100 --> 15:58.900
Y-Yeah...

15:59.060 --> 16:00.780
Tell the truth right now!

16:00.780 --> 16:02.480
-Liar!

16:01.980 --> 16:03.010
-I can't believe you!

16:03.110 --> 16:04.030
-You're the worst.

16:04.030 --> 16:05.620
Alright! That's enough.

16:06.320 --> 16:10.450
From what I've heard, there isn't any evidence
to prove they're the culprits.

16:10.550 --> 16:11.660
But...

16:11.660 --> 16:16.170
Man! We were falsely accused and my
feelings are hurt.

16:17.370 --> 16:19.470
I'm bleeding from my scar, mama!

16:19.670 --> 16:21.690
I lived without lying...

16:22.090 --> 16:24.530
Mama! What's so bad about me?

16:24.630 --> 16:27.270
Mama! Am I a bad kid?!

16:27.470 --> 16:29.450
Tell me, mama!

16:29.470 --> 16:33.400
But still! Chitose Midori's underwear
got stolen!

16:33.600 --> 16:36.020
W-Wait! We didn't do that!

16:36.520 --> 16:40.680
Y-Yeah! We didn't have enough
time to do that.

16:40.980 --> 16:42.770
So it was YOU guys!

16:42.770 --> 16:43.700
Then it's decided!

16:43.700 --> 16:46.000
We will have you guys leave immediately!

16:46.070 --> 16:46.830
Yeah! Get out!

16:46.830 --> 16:47.840
Get out!

16:47.950 --> 16:50.200
Go back to the country!

16:50.200 --> 16:52.240
Geez, everyone, wait!

16:52.240 --> 16:54.550
If you people say so, then I can't help it!

16:55.350 --> 16:56.870
Are you going to leave!

16:56.870 --> 17:01.000
How can we go home when we've been accused
of being underwear thieves?

17:01.000 --> 17:06.810
We will prove our innocence by
catching the real thief!

17:06.920 --> 17:08.170
Yeah, that's right!

17:08.170 --> 17:09.930
"Catching"? But how?

17:10.430 --> 17:11.840
Hey, Yuusuke.

17:11.840 --> 17:13.610
W-Why am I involved?!

17:19.810 --> 17:23.210
Geez, why are we involved...?

17:23.310 --> 17:25.810
Hey, are you keeping watch?

17:26.110 --> 17:35.850
Yeah I am, since I'm good at looking at things...

17:38.250 --> 17:41.900
Damn, even at night the city is very hot.

17:42.170 --> 17:47.720
By now we should have been sleeping
in our air-conditioned room.

17:47.920 --> 17:49.840
-Whose fault do you think this is?

17:49.550 --> 17:52.140
-That's why we're also patrolling!

17:52.220 --> 17:54.320
-Yeah. Don't be so harsh dude!

17:54.320 --> 17:55.800
It's only natural!

17:56.220 --> 17:59.480
But it's so hot my sweat won't
stop dripping.

17:59.480 --> 18:01.540
Yuusuke, handcrief.

18:01.540 --> 18:02.560
I don't have one.

18:02.770 --> 18:03.970
How about you, Ichibanboshi?

18:03.970 --> 18:06.250
Handcrief?

18:06.450 --> 18:07.800
Handcrief!

18:09.650 --> 18:10.650
Here!

18:10.650 --> 18:11.610
Thank you.

18:11.610 --> 18:16.270
But, can we really catch the thief?
We're leaving tomorrow you know.

18:16.580 --> 18:18.400
I think it's alright if we don't catch him.

18:19.200 --> 18:21.510
Someday the real thief will be caught and maybe they'll say

18:21.910 --> 18:24.990
"Oh, we done something so awful to Ijuuin-kun!"

18:25.580 --> 18:29.240
"Oh yeah, I'll write him a letter!"

18:29.510 --> 18:31.720
Oh! What a well-thought plan!

18:31.720 --> 18:37.900
Also, this type of guys are addicted, so they can't control
their desire and will come again.

18:38.100 --> 18:40.500
It could happen you know!

18:41.100 --> 18:44.060
Don't start saying stupid things like that.

18:45.250 --> 18:46.900
That's a trap.

18:47.000 --> 18:48.200
Say so earlier!

18:48.360 --> 18:52.550
By the way, there should be a bunch of pitfals with spike traps around here!

18:52.950 --> 18:54.330
Are they out to kill us?

18:56.530 --> 18:57.100
Hmm?

19:02.600 --> 19:04.510
Here, it's a present.

19:07.380 --> 19:10.490
I'm sorry, all because of my underwear...

19:10.590 --> 19:13.760
Don't worry about it.
We're doing this to clear ourselves.

19:14.760 --> 19:16.080
Yuusuke-kun.

19:16.180 --> 19:16.700
Hm?

19:18.100 --> 19:20.600
Please confess.
I won't tell anyone.

19:20.700 --> 19:21.230
Huh?

19:21.430 --> 19:26.020
Yuusuke-kun, the one who tried to make "sneaky night-love" with me was you, wasn't it?

19:26.020 --> 19:26.920
Eh?

19:27.020 --> 19:30.490
You're the one who stole my underwear right?

19:30.690 --> 19:33.400
No, I didn't!
Seriously, I didn't!

19:35.500 --> 19:37.940
I see... just as I thought.

19:38.240 --> 19:39.180
How dissapointing.

19:39.300 --> 19:40.000
Eh...?

19:43.080 --> 19:46.370
Why are you so kind to us guys?

19:46.370 --> 19:49.570
I'm not being kind to "you guys".

19:49.940 --> 19:50.830
You're not?

19:51.630 --> 19:53.820
Gosh, you're dull aren't you?

19:54.200 --> 19:54.900
Eh?

19:55.220 --> 19:58.800
Apart from that... can I ask you question #1?

19:58.970 --> 19:59.930
Y-Yeah.

19:59.930 --> 20:01.870
Why did you protect me?

20:02.680 --> 20:04.020
Protect you? When?

20:04.020 --> 20:07.280
Remember the first time we meet at
the nurse's office.

20:07.980 --> 20:12.200
I poured water on you, and you didn't say anything to the nurse.

20:12.500 --> 20:15.400
Oh, that.

20:15.900 --> 20:16.900
Yeah!

20:17.070 --> 20:19.060
Um, there's no deep meaning to it.

20:19.160 --> 20:20.250
Are you sure.

20:20.450 --> 20:22.470
If I had to pick one...

20:22.470 --> 20:23.710
Had to pick one...?

20:26.210 --> 20:27.050
...I don't know?

20:29.040 --> 20:32.170
Question #2.
Why are you asking me that?

20:32.170 --> 20:34.290
Eh? Um... well...

20:35.090 --> 20:38.390
How should I say this... there's no
deep meaning to it.

20:38.510 --> 20:39.250
I see.

20:40.050 --> 20:43.030
The rice ball is delicious!

20:43.330 --> 20:44.880
What's wrong?

20:45.080 --> 20:47.430
Nothing!

20:49.730 --> 20:52.700
So there are this many stars...

20:52.700 --> 20:53.400
Eh?

20:53.480 --> 20:57.390
I don't look up at the night's sky very often.

20:57.490 --> 20:59.840
There are more stars than this.

21:01.800 --> 21:03.200
Really?

21:03.240 --> 21:05.890
Yeah.
Since my school is in the countryside...

21:06.290 --> 21:11.140
The air is clearer, and even though they're the exact same stars, they look brighter.

21:11.540 --> 21:12.780
There's way more than this.

21:13.380 --> 21:17.340
And even when there isn't a moon, the
stars can light up the mountains.

21:20.840 --> 21:26.120
I would like to see a starlit sky like that.
Yuusuke-kun.

21:26.520 --> 21:27.240
Hm?

21:27.640 --> 21:32.120
Question #3.
Could I visit you sometime?

21:33.020 --> 21:35.980
Of course! Anytime!

21:37.400 --> 21:39.400
Then, it's a promise!

21:56.380 --> 21:57.940
Was it a dream?

21:58.440 --> 22:00.400
I'm sorry.
I fell asleep.

22:00.900 --> 22:03.100
No, it's alright.

22:06.930 --> 22:08.430
Well then, good luck.

22:09.000 --> 22:10.400
Thanks.

22:13.230 --> 22:15.040
What are you doing?!

22:16.940 --> 22:20.440
You did it huh!
I know you did it!

22:20.440 --> 22:22.200
Did what?

22:23.310 --> 22:24.820
"Look at the stars"!

22:24.820 --> 22:26.160
Okay, repeat!

22:26.160 --> 22:27.360
"Look at the stars"!

22:28.160 --> 22:30.660
Okay! Release!

22:30.660 --> 22:33.290
Relax and sex!

22:34.890 --> 22:37.090
You did it right?

22:37.400 --> 22:42.220
You did it right?!

22:41.800 --> 22:42.220
What?

22:42.220 --> 22:44.270
Hey, what are you doing?

22:44.340 --> 22:48.680
He ditched grounds and flirted with a girl!

22:48.680 --> 22:50.140
Flirted with a girl?

22:50.140 --> 22:53.540
What are you talking about? No! That's not it!

22:54.440 --> 22:56.480
No, well... it's not wrong I guess...

22:56.980 --> 22:59.330
But I wasn't flirting!

22:59.930 --> 23:06.970
LOVE!

23:09.540 --> 23:11.870
Are you ok?

23:11.620 --> 23:13.670
Yuusuke-kun, are you ok?

23:30.870 --> 23:32.840
This is the true culprit!

23:35.440 --> 23:39.970
Well, in this season the grown-up chicks leave the nest and become independent.

23:40.360 --> 23:44.400
And they take practically anything to make the nest.

23:44.700 --> 23:47.870
Tejin-senpai, you have a wide range of knowledge... you're well informed!

23:47.870 --> 23:49.340
Thanks.

23:52.440 --> 23:54.050
Could I talk to you a bit?

23:54.250 --> 23:55.040
Huh?

23:55.040 --> 24:00.700
Actually... I saw it in the rice cracker bag...
It said "A cute good story".

24:01.000 --> 24:05.490
Man, and you called us underwear thieves.

24:05.500 --> 24:06.900
Um...

24:07.300 --> 24:09.400
Ah! That!

24:11.390 --> 24:14.270
Those are the panties that I lost last night!

24:15.770 --> 24:17.000
T-This is...

24:18.300 --> 24:20.150
As I thought, you are...!

24:20.150 --> 24:21.160
Wait!

24:22.190 --> 24:26.440
I see... so you love me that much?

24:28.680 --> 24:31.470
The fact that you touched my breast at the haunted house...

24:32.770 --> 24:36.610
The fact that you were watching my slip during tennis practice...

24:36.910 --> 24:38.080
I couldn't forgive it.

24:38.980 --> 24:47.370
So this was all... Ijuuin-kun...
No, darling! They were expressions of love to me!

24:47.770 --> 24:49.330
Darling!

24:54.430 --> 24:55.850
So, what is it?

24:55.850 --> 24:59.540
Um, if you want to, you could come to our
school for the supplementary class!

25:00.940 --> 25:01.920
Yuusuke-kun?

25:01.950 --> 25:03.630
Chitose!

25:03.920 --> 25:05.030
W-What?!

25:05.190 --> 25:06.610
We're going home right now!

25:06.110 --> 25:06.810
Why?!

25:07.280 --> 25:10.720
Darling! Touch my breast!

25:10.820 --> 25:13.340
Oh, why are you so embarrassed?

25:13.660 --> 25:15.660
H-Help!

25:15.700 --> 25:18.660
Darlin! I got you!

25:18.660 --> 25:21.510
Stop it! Don't touch me!
Don't lick! Don't bite me!

25:21.540 --> 25:24.480
You're noisy darling!

25:23.880 --> 25:24.880
Stop!

25:28.040 --> 25:29.200
Why me?
